      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That smile gives me a fresh sense of\r\nwonder again and again!\r\nIn fact, just the sight of her standing next to\r\nyou is amazingly inspiring - you know what I mean?",
        "Jp" : "その微笑みで何度でも新鮮な感動をくれる！\r\nむしろ、隣に立っている姿が視界に入るだけで\r\n驚くほど感動してしまう――わかるだろう？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 820832,
